    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A substantial 5-bedroom detached property (former Public House) situated at Main Street, Ballindine, Co. Mayo. It is situated at the centre of Ballindine village close to all schools, shopping centre, restaurants, church etc. It extends to circa .624 sq.mt.\r\n\r\nThe property is presented in poor condition and requires complete renovation internally.\r\n\r\nThe accomodation comprises of:\r\n\r\nGround Floor - Entrance Hallway, Bar Area, Entrance Hallway 2, Sitting Room, Kitchen, Function Room and 4 X WC's.\r\n\r\n1st Floor - 5 Bedrooms, 2 Bathrooms.and a Store Room.\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent redevelopment opportunity and viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 3.2m x 2.2m \r\n\r\n\r\nBar Area - 9.1m x 9.1m \r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway 2 - 2.9m x 1.914m \r\n\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 6.6m x 3.6m \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.41m x 2.58m \r\n\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC - 3.2m x 2.7m \r\n\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC 2 - 3.7m x 3.2m \r\n\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC 3 - 3.4m x 3.3m \r\n\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC 4 - 4.3m x 4.2m \r\n\r\n\r\nFunction Room - 16.5m x 14.71m \r\n\r\n\r\n1st Floor - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.6m x 3.6m \r\n\r\n\r\nUpstairs Bathroom - 2.79m x 2.01m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.6m x 3.18m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.5m x 3.26m \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom 2 - 1.86m x 1.79m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.8m x 2.77m \r\n\r\n\r\nUpstairs - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 - 4.8m x 4.1m \r\n\r\n\r\nStore Room - 2.8m x 1.7m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
